        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG109 Stainless Steel Leversets with 206 Flush Rose</b>\r\n<p>\r\n All stainless steel levers in PVD coated finishes. Extremely resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches and abrasion making it an ideal material for door hardware. It needs little looking after and does not degrade in appearance or function with use.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nLever Style: SIG109<br>\r\nFlush Rose: SIG206<br>\r\nAdjustable Door thickness 1 3/8\" to 2\"<br>\r\nDoes NOT Fit standard 2-1/8\" door cut outs<br>\r\nAll Levers meet <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)</a><br>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhen choosing a function:\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Dummy: For use as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li>Double Dummy: Stationary both sides of door</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking. Includes privacy inside thumbturn bolt and exterior emergency release plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<br>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "AHI Stainless Steel  Leverset SIG109/206",
                "description": "AHI SIG109 Stainless Steel Leversets with 206 Flush Rose. All stainless steel levers in PVD coated finishes.",
                "keywords": "AHI-SIG109, AHI SIG109 Stainless Steel Leversets, satin stainless steel levers, AHI hardware satin stainless door levers, AHI-SIG109xx/206 rose, flush rose leversets,"
            },
